In article 332 of the Constitution,—                           Amendment of
Article 332 

(a) in clause (3A), for the figures "2000", the figures "2026" shall be 
substituted; 

(b) in clause (3B), for the figures "2000", the figures "2026" shall be 
substituted;

Amendment of article 170. - In article 170 of the Constitution,-
(i) in clause (2), in the Explanation, in the proviso, for the figures "1991", 
the figures "2001" shall be substituted; 
(ii) in clause (3), in the Explanation, in the third proviso, for the figures 
"1991", the figures "2001" shall be substituted;
